    "title": "Program Tuesday for dementia caregivers",
    "text": "The Rhode Island chapter of the Alzheimer’s Association will present its “Empowered Caregiver” program at 1:30 p.m. Tuesday, Jan. 20, at the library, 26 North Road. The free program is part of an educational series that teaches caregivers to navigate the responsibilities of watching someone living with dementia. The program will explore the role of the caregiver, the changes they may experience, how the condition affects communication and recognizing when additional help is needed.\nThe program also will detail ways for caregivers to support their patients’ independence while balancing safety and managing expectations.",
